factory-template
================

This repository vendors or adapts material from the following projects.

1. anthropics/skills — frontend-design
   https://github.com/anthropics/skills (skills/frontend-design)
   Licence: Apache License 2.0
   Vendored unchanged in template/.claude/skills/frontend-design/ (SKILL.md and the
   licence text in LICENSE.txt). The factory installs it, git-excluded, into the target
   repo; the builder preloads it for new UI work.

2. obra/superpowers — test-driven-development, verification-before-completion,
   systematic-debugging, receiving-code-review, writing-good-tests
   https://github.com/obra/superpowers
   Licence: MIT (Copyright (c) 2025 Jesse Vincent)
   Not vendored: short sections distilled in our own words into
   template/.claude/agents/factory-builder.md (Discipline, Handling findings),
   factory-reviewer-audit.md (Red-green evidence and debugging, Test quality) and
   factory-reviewer-code.md (Test quality). Each section names its source.

